# Arenal Water Sports skill routing

Before implementing or changing code:

1. Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root (contract and skill router).
2. Default to the **elite senior Next.js engineer** bar in `AGENTS.md` on every prompt — no junior syntax, tutorial patterns, or weak typing.
3. Load every relevant skill from `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` as listed in that catalog.
4. Treat those `SKILL.md` files as the source of truth. Do not duplicate or override skill content in other rule files.
5. Requirements come from `docs/proyecto/historias-de-usuario.md`.

IDE-specific files (`CLAUDE.md`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, this rule) are pointers only.
